.com/experience-salzburg/tours-packages-concerts/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Walk the Kapuzinerberg and Monchsberg trails","type":"trail","detail":"Forest paths climb straight out of the old town to the Franziskischlossl and cliff-edge lookouts facing the fortress.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":24,"urls":["https://freewalkingtoursalzburg.com/hiking-in-salzburg-city/","https://mybackyardandbeyond.com/kapuzinerberg-hiking-salzburg-austria/","https://janameerman.com/salzburg-viewpoints/","https://www.visit-salzburg.net/travel/hiking.htm"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Day hike Gaisberg or Untersberg","type":"trail","detail":"Gaisberg is a 900 m climb you can shortcut by bus; Untersberg adds ladders and a 1,300 m ascent with the city tiny below.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":24,"urls":["https://www.panoramatours.com/en/salzburg/salzburg-highlights/points-of-interest/mountains-of-salzburg/","https://www.visit-salzburg.net/travel/hiking.htm","https://tripacho.com/blog/hiking-near-salzburg-88fdd85f-f6afaca4","https://www.komoot.com/highlight/3075996"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Advent markets and Krampus parades","type":"festival","detail":"The Christkindlmarkt around the cathedral runs from late November with about 100 stalls, carols and Krampus runs after dark.","season":[11,12,1],"link":"https://www.salzburg.info/en/salzburg/advent/salzburg-christmas-market","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":24,"urls":["https://www.salzburg.info/en/salzburg/advent/salzburg-christmas-market","https://www.sacher.com/en/blog/salzburgs-christmas-market-guide/","https://www.christmasmarketsaustria.com/salzburg.php"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Hohensalzburg fortress by funicular","type":"experience","detail":"Central Europe's largest intact medieval castle; ride the funicular up for rampart views, or stay for a Mozart dinner concert.","link":"https://www.viator.com/Salzburg-attractions/Hohensalzburg-Fo